# sdd-visualizer Context

This repository holds the spec-driven development method and the documentation visualizer.

The visualizer application lives here:

```text
apps/web/                         React
  src/pages/<Page>/               page and its states
  src/features/<feature>/         screen scenario: forms, actions
  src/shared/                     shared components and Nest API client

apps/server/                      NestJS
  src/main.ts
  src/app.module.ts
  src/ssr/                        React render, HTML, hydration payload
  src/<feature>/                  module, controller, service, dto
```

The visualizer has no database. It reads and writes files:

- feature specs: `docs/<проект>/<фича>/{in-progress|ready-to-implement|done}/`
- git remote and token: `global/configs.yaml` (hidden from the document tree)

